["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/query", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Dataset is publicly available, but not all at once, and can only be accessed through queries which return parts of the dataset.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
