["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseExpression", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A licenseExpression enables the representation, in a single string, of a\ncombination of one or more licenses, together with additions such as license\nexceptions.\n\nThe syntax for a licenseExpression string is set forth in the corresponding\nAnnex of this document\n(\"SPDX license expressions\").\nA licenseExpression string is not valid if it does not conform to the grammar\nset forth in that Annex.\n\nThe ExpandedLicensing profile can be used to represent the complete parsed\nlicense expression as a combination of license objects.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/ExtendableLicense", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Abstract class representing a License or an OrLaterOperator.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SbomType/deployed", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/InspectionProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/UseProcess", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/responsibility", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Describes the specific responsibility of a Role.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Software/SoftwarePurpose/firmware", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The Element provides low level control over a device's hardware.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/additionalInformation", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Additional relevance information.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nb137e20982024adf94f83f3d3b5b03a4", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#datatype", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension/cdxPropName", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Extension", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/suppliedBy", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Identify the actual distribution source for the artifact (e.g., snippet, file,\npackage, vulnerability) or VulnAssessmentRelationship being referenced.\n\nThis may or may not be different from the originating distribution source\nfor the artifact (e.g., snippet, file, package, vulnerability) or\nVulnAssessmentRelationship.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nfed31ea863534df5a263dc1562dcee59", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/CvssSeverityType/none", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Hardware/massOfHardware", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/MeasureOfMass", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/affects", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core", "globalId", "", ""]
["_:Nd0ca254921dc40fda6f7bdef6e72f93c", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest", "_:N1abec6620c56412d83f997d0ac234f8a", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/descendantOf", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "The from Element is a descendant of each to Element.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/locatedAt", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "from Element located at a specific to Location. A time period is optional.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nf28fa49da21f4a95a4fd5fb6d32a2435", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#BlankNodeOrIRI", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/countyCode", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A code that identifies a county. A county is a territorial division in some countries, often forming a primary unit of local administration.\n\nIn the US, a county is a political and administrative division of a state.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/rootElement", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This property is used to denote the root Element(s) of a tree of elements contained in a BOM.\nThe tree consists of other elements directly and indirectly related through properties or Relationships from the root.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/LifecycleScopeType/development", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/altWebPage", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#NamedIndividual", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/licenseText", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range", "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string", "globalId", "", ""]
["_:Naefe7c9e70ed460395e98bb78f5469d5", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/License", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/ConjunctiveLicenseSet", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A ConjunctiveLicenseSet indicates that _each_ of its subsidiary\nAnyLicenseInfos apply. In other words, a ConjunctiveLicenseSet of two or\nmore licenses represents a licensing situation where _all_ of the specified\nlicenses are to be complied with. It is represented in the SPDX License\nExpression Syntax by the AND operator.\n\nIt is syntactically correct to specify a ConjunctiveLicenseSet where the\nsubsidiary AnyLicenseInfos may be \"incompatible\" according to a particular\ninterpretation of the corresponding Licenses.\nThe\nSPDX License Expression Syntax\ndoes not take into account interpretation of license texts, which is\nleft to the consumer of SPDX data to determine for themselves.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/isDeprecatedAdditionId", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Specifies whether an additional text identifier has been marked as deprecated.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Element", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core", "globalId", "", ""]
["_:N7d6a4bd54673484e82dbdbc0ab8c174f", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest", "_:N48e2185bbfc14659893c8905b9262d2e", "localId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/Hash", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A hash is a grouping of characteristics unique to the result\nof applying a mathematical algorithm\nthat maps data of arbitrary size to a bit string (the hash)\nand is a one-way function, that is,\na function which is practically infeasible to invert.\n\nThis is commonly used for integrity checking of data.\n\nPlease note that different profiles may also provide additional methods for verifying the integrity of specific subclasses of Elements.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/catalogType", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SimpleLicensing/customIdToLicense", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition", "Maps a \"LicenseRef-\" string for a custom license or a \"AdditionRef-\" string for\na custom license addition to a CustomLicense, a CustomLicenseAddition, or a\nSimpleLicensingText.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nf5330a67f9874c5fb408596a7e214fab", "http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#class", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/ExpandedLicensing/WithAdditionOperator", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/RelationshipType/describes", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "The from Element describes each to Element. To denote the root(s) of a tree of elements in a collection, the rootElement property shall be used.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["_:Nfd140ecf97f9474da06a56a593ad460b", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/DatasetAvailabilityType/registration", "globalId", "", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType/demonstration", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type", "https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/VerificationType", "globalId", "", ""]
