["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Security/actionStatementTime", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "When a VEX statement communicates an affected status, the author shall\ninclude an action statement with a recommended action to help mitigate the\nvulnerability's impact. The actionStatementTime property records the time\nwhen the action statement was first communicated.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
