["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/SoftwareAgent", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A SoftwareAgent is a software program that is given the authority (similar to a\nuser's authority) to act on a system.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
