["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalMap", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "An external map is a map of Element identifiers that are used within an\nSpdxDocument but defined external to that SpdxDocument.\nThe external map provides details about the externally-defined Element\nsuch as its provenance, where to retrieve it, and how to verify its integrity.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
