["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/SupplyChain/DefinedStateProcess", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "This process is used to determine the state of an affected Element.\nThe DefinedStateProcess is used to define a list of valid states of an affected Element.\n\nA DefinedStateProcess may describe the steps or conditions required to move an entity from one state to another.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
