["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/postalName", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "A postal name refers to the official name of a city, town, or locality as recognized by a postal system for mail delivery purposes. It ensures accurate addressing and routing of mail.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
