["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Core/ExternalRefType/x509Cert", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "A reference to an X.509 certificate as defined in RFC 1422 <https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/rfc1422/>. The media type shall be one of application/x-x509-ca-cert or application/x-x509-user-cert.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Service/AuthenticationProtocolType/ocsp", "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment", "Online Certificate Status Protocol, or OCSP, is a common scheme used to maintain the security of a server and other network resources.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
