["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/Dataset/datasetType", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "Describes the datatype contained in the dataset.\n\nFor example, a dataset can be an image dataset for computer vision applications, a text dataset such as the contents of a book or Wikipedia article, or sometimes a multimodal dataset that contains multiple types of data.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
