["https://spdx.org/rdf/3/terms/FunctionalSafety/EvidenceRelationship", "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#note", "EvidenceRelationship defines the association between pieces of evidence and EvaluationResult. This establishes traceability and contextual linkage between evidence items, supporting certification, verification, and audit activities.", "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString", "en", ""]
